<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`在 fdemo 里看 IOC，两处。

第一处是 UserController。它里面一行 lookup 泛型 UserService。注意拿到的是接口类型的 bean，而实现类是 UserServiceImpl。IOC 用「实现的接口」做了索引，所以按接口取是天然支持的。这也解释了右边三张索引表的第二张为什么重要。

第二处是 CurrentUserController。它上面有 @WeavedController，然后 @BeanMeta 指定 scope 是 prototype，注意这个 BeanMeta 必须写在 @WeavedController 下面。prototype 意味着每次访问都 new 一个——它的 init 里有一行 println，每访问一次就会打印一次。这是视频里证明 prototype 生效的最简单方式。

最后是 @Configuration 加 @BeanInit。@Configuration 修饰的类自己不会进容器，但它里面被 @BeanInit 修饰的公共成员函数都是 bean 初始化函数，静态和实例的都可以。

一句话总结：@Configuration 是「配置容器」，不是 bean。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 6 章 · IOC f_bean · 6.5 / 6.6</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>在 fdemo 里看 IOC</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>@Configuration + @BeanInit</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 10 }}>user/src/controller/UserController.cj</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>@Controller</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>public class UserController {"{"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    private let userService = lookup<UserService>()"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>{"    // 拿到的是接口类型的 bean，实现类是 UserServiceImpl"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"}"}</Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#1E293B', marginTop: 10, marginBottom: 10 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>@WeavedController</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"@BeanMeta[scope: BeanScope.prototype]   // 必须写在 @WeavedController 下面"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>public class CurrentUserController {"{"} ... {"}"}</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 8 }}>@Configuration + @BeanInit</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"@Configuration        // 这个类本身不被 IOC 管理"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>public class AppConfig {"{"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    @BeanInit"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    public func initSomething(): Unit { ... }"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"}"}</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 400, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>按接口取，天然支持</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 10 }}>IOC 用「实现的接口」建了索引，所以 lookup 泛型 UserService 能拿到 UserServiceImpl。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 10 }}>同一个接口有多个实现时，用 BeanMeta 的 primary 和 order 决定取哪一个。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #F59E0B', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F59E0B' }}>证明 prototype 生效</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 10 }}>CurrentUserController 的 init 里有一行 println。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 10 }}>每访问一次这个接口，控制台就会多打一行 —— 这是最直观的证明方式。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

